q q .796078 .835294 .870588 RG .5 w 56.16 754 m 555.84 754 l S .090196 .196078 .301961 rg BT/F2 7.5 Tf 56.16 763 TD (GOLDEN ARROWS DATASET V3.1)Tj ET .364706 .419608 .470588 rg BT/F1 7.5 Tf 467.91 763 TD (DATASET DESCRIPTION)Tj ET 56.16 35 m 555.84 35 l S BT/F1 8 Tf 56.16 23 TD (Version 3.1 | Simulation-generated research resource)Tj ET BT 526.04 23 TD (Page 11)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 62.16 718.04 cm .090196 .196078 .301961 rg BT/F2 16 Tf 0 3 TD (19. Limitations \(continued\))Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 62.16 645.04 cm .14902 .215686 .27451 rg BT/F1 9.4 Tf 0 55.6 TD (The mission controller is scripted, and Advanced Swarm Behavior is scripted telemetry, not a trained policy. Mission)Tj 0 -13 TD (transitions and the 30 drone records within each transition are dependent/nested observations. Temporal semantics)Tj T* (require task-specific review, and fields under state_after are not automatically pre-action observations. Feature)Tj T* (exclusion does not guarantee absence of leakage. The data establish no real-world safety or performance claim,)Tj T* (deployment-readiness claim, or causal-validity guarantee.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 62.16 620.04 cm .090196 .196078 .301961 rg BT/F2 16 Tf 0 3 TD (20. Publication Scope)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 62.16 560.04 cm .14902 .215686 .27451 rg BT/F1 9.4 Tf 0 42.6 TD (The publication package contains raw mission records, processed rich transitions, metadata, schemas, validation)Tj 0 -13 TD (artifacts, and optional preprocessing examples. It does not contain train.csv, validation.csv, test.csv, generated)Tj T* (ML-ready datasets, ml_ready directories, analysis directories, development artifacts, pilot datasets, or staging)Tj T* (datasets. Derived ML outputs are generated locally by researchers.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 62.16 535.04 cm .090196 .196078 .301961 rg BT/F2 16 Tf 0 3 TD (21. Final Package Structure)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 62.16 408.24 cm .14902 .215686 .27451 rg BT/F3 8.3 Tf 8 110.5 TD (Golden_Arrows_Dataset_V3.1/)Tj 0 -10.800003 TD (|-- data/)Tj T* (|   |-- metadata.csv, raw/missions/, processed/transitions/)Tj T* (|-- schema/)Tj T* (|   `-- mission_schema.json, transition_schema.json, behavior_schema.json)Tj 0 -10.799999 TD (|-- validation/)Tj T* (|   `-- dataset_validation_report.txt, dataset_statistics.json)Tj T* (|-- examples/preprocessing/)Tj T* (|   `-- README.md, prepare_state_only.py, prepare_behavior_aware.py)Tj 0 -10.8 TD (|-- README.md, LICENSE, CITATION.cff, CHANGELOG.md,)Tj T* (`-- dataset_card.md, dataset_description.pdf)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 62.16 386.24 cm .090196 .196078 .301961 rg BT/F2 16 Tf 0 3 TD (22. Related Documentation and Citation)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 62.16 339.24 cm .14902 .215686 .27451 rg BT/F1 9.4 Tf 0 29.6 TD (See README.md, dataset_card.md, CITATION.cff, CHANGELOG.md, schema materials, validation artifacts, and)Tj 0 -13 TD (preprocessing examples. A V3.1 DOI has not been assigned. The DOI )Tj[-11898]TJ ( belongs to V3.0)Tj T* (only and must not be cited as a V3.1 DOI.)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 62.16 314.24 cm .090196 .196078 .301961 rg BT/F2 16 Tf 0 3 TD (23. Closing Statement)Tj ET Q q 1 0 0 1 62.16 280.24 cm .14902 .215686 .27451 rg BT/F1 9.4 Tf 0 16.6 TD (Golden Arrows Dataset V3.1 is a simulation-generated research resource for multi-drone swarm transition analysis. It)Tj 0 -13 TD (preserves rich transition information while documenting its simulation scope and limitations.)Tj ET Q Q
